                "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
                "source": "PubMed",
                "id": "20018881"
              }
            ],
            "value": "Homodimer, may form higher-order multimers on DNA. Non-dimerized protein does not stimulate LigD ligase activity. Probably interacts with LigD"
          }
        ],
